{"title":"Career Roadmap · EHS Officer","role":"EHS Officer","summary":"An EHS Officer helps organisations control environmental impacts, workplace hazards, occupational health and safety risks, emergency preparedness, regulatory compliance and incident prevention.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. Environmental Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role is highly practical and combines environmental science + industrial safety + compliance + risk assessment + documentation + audits."},{"type":"note","label":"Typical pathway","text":"B.Sc. Environmental Science → EHS/Safety Internship → EHS Trainee → EHS Officer → Senior EHS Officer → EHS Manager → HSE/EHS Lead → EHS Head"},{"type":"note","label":"Career reality","text":"A B.Sc. Environmental Science can provide a route into EHS, but many industrial employers prefer additional qualifications in occupational health & safety, industrial safety, environmental management or relevant statutory safety credentials. Exact legal eligibility for designated safety roles depends on the applicable Indian regulations, state rules and industry."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Environmental science, workplace safety and hazard fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Industrial safety, environmental monitoring and compliance"}],[{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"EHS internship + risk assessment + audit skills"}],[{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"EHS Trainee / Junior EHS Officer"}],[{"text":"2030–2034"},{"text":"Independent safety and environmental responsibilities"}],[{"text":"2034–2038"},{"text":"Senior EHS Officer / EHS Specialist"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"EHS Manager / HSE Lead"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"EHS Head / Regional HSE Manager / Sustainability & EHS Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Environmental + safety foundation"},{"text":"Ecology, chemistry, pollution, workplace hazards"},{"text":"Environmental project"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Industrial EHS"},{"text":"Occupational safety, waste, air/water monitoring"},{"text":"Field/lab project"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Risk & compliance"},{"text":"HIRA, JSA, emergency response, audits"},{"text":"EHS internship"}],[{"text":"4th Year / Advanced"},{"text":"Professional EHS"},{"text":"ISO 14001, ISO 45001, incident investigation, reporting"},{"text":"EHS project + internship"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental science"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ecology"},{"text":"Environmental chemistry"},{"text":"Environmental biology"},{"text":"Soil science"},{"text":"Hydrology"},{"text":"Atmospheric science"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Natural resources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pollution"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air pollution"},{"text":"Water pollution"},{"text":"Soil pollution"},{"text":"Noise pollution"},{"text":"Solid waste"},{"text":"Hazardous waste"},{"text":"Industrial emissions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workplace hazards"},{"text":"PPE"},{"text":"Fire safety"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Chemical safety"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Emergency procedures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Industrial Environment & Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from general environmental science into industrial applications."},{"type":"h","text":"Occupational safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hazard identification"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Unsafe acts/conditions"},{"text":"Hierarchy of controls"},{"text":"PPE selection"},{"text":"Permit-to-work systems"},{"text":"Lockout/Tagout concepts"},{"text":"Confined-space safety"},{"text":"Work-at-height safety"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Machine safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Effluent treatment"},{"text":"Sewage treatment"},{"text":"Air-emission control"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Hazardous waste"},{"text":"Chemical storage"},{"text":"Spill management"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — EHS Professional Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"This year should focus on risk management and compliance."},{"type":"h","text":"Risk assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hazard Identification","Risk Assessment","Control Measures","Monitoring","Review"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HIRA"},{"text":"JSA/JHA"},{"text":"Risk matrix"},{"text":"Bow-tie concepts"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Incident investigation"},{"text":"Near-miss reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fire emergencies"},{"text":"Chemical spills"},{"text":"Gas leaks"},{"text":"Electrical incidents"},{"text":"Medical emergencies"},{"text":"Evacuation"},{"text":"Emergency response plans"},{"text":"Mock drills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air-quality monitoring"},{"text":"Stack emissions"},{"text":"Water-quality testing"},{"text":"Effluent testing"},{"text":"Noise monitoring"},{"text":"Waste audits"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary EHS direction."},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Industrial Safety"},{"text":"Workplace hazards and accident prevention"}],[{"text":"Environmental Compliance"},